join character_overlay center [animation="Instant In"]
join character_oldMan center
character_richGirl: So once I take this, I'll get a vision of when I wish to see the most?
character_richGirl: Sounds straightforward enough, no use waiting any longer then!
She chugs the potion
if {success} == true:
	character_richGirl: ...
	character_richGirl: Ah... So that's how it is.
	character_richGirl: ...
	character_richGirl: Hm... Oh?
	character_richGirl: Just a lot to think about, that's all.
	character_richGirl: You wanna know more you say?
	character_richGirl: ...I just have a lot to consider for my future.
	character_richGirl: I am a prince after all. Anything more than that is confidential info sorry, heh~
	character_richGirl: Thanks again for your service, impressive as ever!
	character_richGirl: I'll be sure to return the favor one day.
else:
	character_richGirl: *cough cough*
	character_richGirl: Gah, my head-
	character_richGirl: Wait that's...
	character_richGirl: WHAT IS THIS... NO, THIS ISN'T WHAT YOU PROMISED ME!?
	character_richGirl: The future!? What I'm seeing is FAR from it, is this a joke to you?
	She clutches her head, but glares at you
	character_richGirl: Be grateful I owe you a favor from before... Otherwise you'd wish you were gone.
	character_richGirl: Close down this shop, I'm not taking no for an answer. 
